@70 = ~Morpheus~
@1 = ~Follow me.~ [IVC11i]
@2 = ~I know exactly what you mean.~ [IVC11j]
@3 = ~I can only show you the door. You're the one that has to walk through it.~ [IVC11k]
@4 = ~You think that's air you're breathing now?~ [IVC11s]
@5 = ~Welcome to the desert of the real.~ [IVC11t]
@6 = ~All I'm offering is the truth. Nothing more.~ [IVC11u]
@7 = ~Yes.~ [IVC11v]
@8 = ~We well know that the reason that most of us are here is because of our... affinity for disobedience.~ [IVC11x]
@9 = ~I'll show you how deep the rabbit hole goes.~ [IVC11y]
@10 = ~That sounds exactly like the thinking of a machine to me.~ [IVC11a]
@11 = ~Don't think you are, know you are.~ [IVC118]
@12 = ~Then hit me. If you can.~ [IVC119]
@13 = ~Free your mind.~ [IVC11g_]
@14 = ~You have to let it all go. Fear, doubt, and disbelief.~ [IVC11h_]
@15 = ~Some of you believe as I believe, some of you do not. But those of you that do, know we are nearing the end of our struggle.~ [IVC11d]
@16 = ~What is The Matrix? Control. The Matrix is a computer generated dream world.~ [IVC11o]
@17 = ~I wasn't aware that my actions required any explanation.~ [IVC11f]
@18 = ~What?~ [IVC11g]
@19 = ~At last.~ [IVC11h]
@20 = ~As you no doubt have guessed, I am Morpheus.~ [IVC110]
@21 = ~That's right, I am.~ [IVC11l_]
@22 = ~He's beginning to believe!~ [IVC11z]
@23 = ~I don't believe it to be a matter of hope. It is simply a matter of time.~ [IVC111]
@24 = ~~ [IVC11l]
@25 = ~Unfortunately, no one can be told what the Matrix is. You have to see it for yourself.~ [IVC11q]
@26 = ~Come on. Stop trying to hit me and hit me!~ [IVC116]
@27 = ~My apologies to all. As you are undoubtedly aware, it has become increasingly difficult to locate a secure broadcast position.~ [IVC11p]
@28 = ~I believe very soon the prophecy will be fulfilled and this war will end.~ [IVC11m]
@29 = ~What is "real"? How do you define "real"? If you're talking about what you can feel, what you can smell, what you can taste and see, then 'real' is simply electrical signals interpreted by your brain.~ [IVC11n]
@30 = ~I didn't say it would be easy, I just said it would be the truth.~ [IVC11w]
@31 = ~Faith, it seems, is not without a sense of irony.~ [IVC11e]
@32 = ~You have the look of a man who accepts what he sees because he's expecting to wake up~ [IVC112]
@33 = ~I'm sure it is.~ [IVC113]
@34 = ~The prophecy will be fulfilled soon. But before it can be, The Oracle must be consulted.~ [IVC11b]
@35 = ~We've survived by hiding from them, by running from them. But they are the gatekeepers. They are guarding all the doors, they are holding all the keys. Which means that sooner or later, someone is going to have to fight them.~ [IVC11r]
@36 = ~I'm trying to tell you that when you're ready, you won't have to.~ [IVC114]
@37 = ~What was said was for you and for you alone.~ [IVC11x_]
@38 = ~How would you know the difference between the dream world and the real world?~ [IVC11y_]
@39 = ~Adaptation, improvisation.~ [IVC115]
@40 = ~I imagine that right now, you're feeling a bit like Alice. Hmm? Tumbling down the rabbit hole? ~ [IVC11c]
@41 = ~Do you believe it now?~ [IVC117]
